From 63e2a04a83d64983ceb34f147dc5f920b4b32f2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 19:02:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Claude Usage app

Shows Claude plan usage (current 5-hour session and weekly limit, plus
per-model weekly limits when reported) with reset countdowns. Reads a
token or relay URL from /claude-usage.json on the SD card.
